<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Rohan Kaushik - Resume</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            color: #0056b3;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .contact-info li {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0056b3;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .experience-item, .education-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .experience-item h3, .education-item h3 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .experience-item p, .education-item p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        ul {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        ul.skills-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        ul.skills-list li {
            background-color: #e2e2e2;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        a {
            color: #0056b3;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <h1>Rohan Kaushik</h1>
            <ul class="contact-info">
                <li><a href="mailto:your.email@example.com">your.email@example.com</a></li>
                <li>(123) 456-7890</li>
                <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourprofile" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://github.com/yourprofile" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
                <li>Your City, Your State</li>
            </ul>
        </header>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Summary</h2>
            <p>A highly motivated and results-oriented [Your Profession] with X years of experience in [Your Key Area 1] and [Your Key Area 2]. Proven ability to [Key Skill 1] and [Key Skill 2], seeking to leverage expertise to contribute to [Type of Company/Industry].</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Experience</h2>
            <div class="experience-item">
                <h3>Job Title</h3>
                <p><strong>Company Name</strong> | City, State | Month Year – Month Year</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Responsible for [Key Responsibility 1], resulting in [Achievement/Impact 1].</li>
                    <li>Developed/Managed [Key Responsibility 2], leading to [Achievement/Impact 2].</li>
                    <li>Collaborated with [Team/Stakeholders] on [Key Project 3], achieving [Achievement/Impact 3].</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="experience-item">
                <h3>Previous Job Title</h3>
                <p><strong>Previous Company</strong> | City, State | Month Year – Month Year</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Implemented [Key Responsibility 1], which improved [Metric/Process].</li>
                    <li>Assisted in [Key Responsibility 2] and contributed to [Outcome].</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <div class="education-item">
                <h3>Degree Name</h3>
                <p><strong>University Name</strong> | City, State</p>
                <p>Month Year – Month Year (or Graduation Year)</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Relevant Coursework: [Course 1], [Course 2]</li>
                    <li>GPA: [Your GPA, if high and relevant]</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="education-item">
                <h3>Another Degree/Certification (if applicable)</h3>
                <p><strong>Institution Name</strong> | City, State</p>
                <p>Month Year – Month Year</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <ul class="skills-list">
                <li>Programming Languages: Python, JavaScript, Java, C++</li>
                <li>Web Technologies: HTML, CSS, React, Node.js</li>
                <li>Databases: SQL, MongoDB</li>
                <li>Tools: Git, Docker, JIRA</li>
                <li>Other: Project Management, Data Analysis, Public Speaking</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Projects (Optional)</h2>
            <div class="project-item">
                <h3><a href="https://yourprojectlink.com" target="_blank">Project Name</a></h3>
                <p>Short description of the project and your role. Technologies used: [Tech 1], [Tech 2].</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Achieved [Result/Impact 1].</li>
                    <li>Implemented [Feature/Functionality].</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
